\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces In this picture we can see the bayesian comparisons between the models, were the performance score used is F1-score. While RDA is performing the best in the beginning, the KNN and LogReg is fast to catch up around 1000 in sample size. The rope that was used for the comparison were $4\%$.}}{4}{figure.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:}{{4}{4}{In this picture we can see the bayesian comparisons between the models, were the performance score used is F1-score. While RDA is performing the best in the beginning, the KNN and LogReg is fast to catch up around 1000 in sample size. The rope that was used for the comparison were $4\%$}{figure.4}{}}
